iously climbing  is inherently dangerous and risky and we  take risks when we do it and I'm still  going to do that for CBS this morning  I'm Nicki batiste so glad emily is okay  I was just gonna say I'm glad she's okay  and doesn't sound like she's changing  her mind about trying it again boyfriend  Adrian Ballinger was here and they  always say that's dangerous they know it  I love doing I'd love to do it
 

